    "summary": "When the bearer's unit declares a charge, you can use Harpooned on a **MONSTER/VEHICLE** enemy unit within 12\" of it that this weapon hit earlier in the turn. If you do:\n\n- the charging unit gets +2 to its [charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step) until the phase ends\n- it must finish its move engaged with that enemy",
